   "ANSWER": "<ul>\n\t<li data-end=\"4579\" data-start=\"4317\">\n\t<p data-end=\"4337\" data-start=\"4320\"><strong data-end=\"4337\" data-start=\"4320\">Design Phase:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"4579\" data-start=\"4341\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4341\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4343\">Classes: <code data-end=\"4361\" data-start=\"4352\">Student</code>, <code data-end=\"4373\" data-start=\"4363\">Feedback</code>, <code data-end=\"4392\" data-start=\"4375\">FeedbackManager</code>, and <code data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4398\">GUIHandler</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4486\" data-start=\"4414\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4486\" data-start=\"4416\">GUI: Swing components &ndash; <code data-end=\"4448\" data-start=\"4440\">JLabel</code>, <code data-end=\"4462\" data-start=\"4450\">JTextField</code>, <code data-end=\"4475\" data-start=\"4464\">JTextArea</code>, <code data-end=\"4486\" data-start=\"4477\">JButton</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4579\" data-start=\"4490\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4579\" data-start=\"4492\">Use of OOP: Encapsulation in <code data-end=\"4531\" data-start=\"4521\">Feedback</code> class; use of arrays or lists to store feedback</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"4811\" data-start=\"4581\">\n\t<p data-end=\"4609\" data-start=\"4584\"><strong data-end=\"4609\" data-start=\"4584\">Implementation Phase:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"4811\" data-start=\"4613\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4656\" data-start=\"4613\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4656\" data-start=\"4615\">Create a feedback form using Java Swing</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4708\" data-start=\"4660\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4708\" data-start=\"4662\">Use <code data-end=\"4682\" data-start=\"4666\">ActionListener</code> to handle submit events</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4771\" data-start=\"4712\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4771\" data-start=\"4714\">Store submitted feedback in an <code data-end=\"4756\" data-start=\"4745\">ArrayList</code> or text file</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4811\" data-start=\"4775\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4811\" data-start=\"4777\">Display acknowledgment to the user</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"5153\" data-start=\"4813\">\n\t<p data-end=\"4843\" data-start=\"4816\"><strong data-end=\"4843\" data-start=\"4816\">Dissertation Structure:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"5153\" data-start=\"4847\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4878\" data-start=\"4847\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4878\" data-start=\"4849\">Abstract: Purpose and scope</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4923\" data-start=\"4882\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4923\" data-start=\"4884\">Introduction: Overview and objectives</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"4981\" data-start=\"4927\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"4981\" data-start=\"4929\">Design: Use case diagram, class diagram, flowchart</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"5032\" data-start=\"4985\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"5032\" data-start=\"4987\">Implementation: Code structure, screenshots</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"5074\" data-start=\"5036\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"5074\" data-start=\"5038\">Testing: Sample inputs and results</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"5135\" data-start=\"5078\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"5135\" data-start=\"5080\">Conclusion: Summary, limitations, future enhancements</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"5153\" data-start=\"5139\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"5153\" data-start=\"5141\">References</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
